  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the demonstration project is to convincingly demonstrate &#x2013; within a realistic production environment in India &#x2013; that Comvis&apos;s vision inspection technology offers significant added value compared to traditional quality control methods in the textile industry.The demonstration will take place at a textile factory in India, where Comvis&apos;s advanced inspection technology will be integrated into existing or new production lines for woven and/or knitted fabrics.The demonstration is being conducted in collaboration with two local integrators/distributors, both of whom possess a network of potential customers and access to suitable demonstration facilities.During the demonstration, the vision inspection system will detect, locate, and document textile defects in real time.</narrative>
  </description>
